class="badge-text" style="font-family: Manrope, sans-serif !important; font-size: 9px !important; font-weight: 800 !important; text-transform: uppercase !important; letter-spacing: 0.8px !important; color: #ff8457 !important; line-height: 1 !important; margin: 0 !important;">Qdoba</span></div></div><label class="label">Choose an item</label><div class="item-grid" id="items"></div><div class="customize" id="customize"><div><label class="label">Portion</label><div class="chips" id="sizes"></div></div><div><label class="label">Amount</label><div class="chips" id="milks"></div></div></div><p class="disclaimer">Results are estimates based on common US menu nutrition data. Location recipes and portions may vary.</p></div><aside class="order-card"><span class="order-label">YOUR ORDER</span><div class="order-empty" id="orderEmpty">Pick an item to<br>see the details <span>↑</span></div><div id="orderContent" hidden><div class="order-title"><span id="orderIcon">☕</span><div><h3 id="orderName"></h3><p id="orderOptions"></p></div></div><div class="calories"><span>Estimated calories</span><strong id="calories">0</strong><small>kcal</small></div><div class="macro-bars"><div><span>Protein <b id="protein">0g</b></span><i><em id="proteinBar"></em></i></div><div><span>Carbs <b id="carbs">0g</b></span><i><em id="carbsBar"></em></i></div><div><span>Fat <b id="fat">0g</b></span><i><em id="fatBar"></em></i></div></div><button class="reset" id="reset">↺ Start again</button></div></aside></div></section>
<section class="seo-article wrap">
  <h2>Everything You Can Do With This Qdoba Calculator</h2>
  <p>Qdoba calorie calculator built the way a real order actually works, not a fixed menu of examples. Choose your base, protein, toppings, and sauces exactly the way you'd order in person.</p>
  
  <h3>How to Use the Qdoba Nutrition Calculator</h3>
  <p>Tracking your bowl shouldn't be complicated. Here is how to get the most accurate nutrition estimate for your next Qdoba run:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Choose Your Base:</strong> Bowl or Salad (0-15 calories), Burrito (~300 cal), Tacos or Quesadilla. The base alone can be the difference between 650 and 950 calories.</li>
    <li><strong>Add Your Protein:</strong> Grilled Adobo Chicken (~190 cal) is leanest. Grilled Steak or Impossible Plant-Based are also great options.</li>
    <li><strong>Build with Toppings:</strong> Add Rice, Beans, Pico de Gallo, and Fajita Veggies. Watch out for Cheese, Sour Cream, and Guacamole where fat climbs fastest.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Popular Qdoba Builds & Their Macros</h3>
  <div class="seo-table-wrap">
    <table class="seo-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Menu Item</th>
